<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="recommended-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_paladin_divinestorm.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Retribution Paladin in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-retribution-paladin-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="$color" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Retribution Paladin gear?</h3>In Mists of Pandaria Classic, just as in other expansions, due to the scarcity of loot drops and the variety of sources they are obtained from, targeting your absolute best-in-slot is often somewhat unrealistic; as a result we've broken down the best drops for Retribution Paladin in Phase 3 from raids, dungeons, reputation, and world bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>Our "best in slot" gear will not necessarily be exactly the same as the set you may have expected. Additionally, mastery &amp; haste are beginning to become very valuable stats and hitting the higher end of their respective scaling curves -- we will additionally be gaining enough haste to reach a major breakpoint and therefore we will be able to stack a bit of extra mastery instead of focusing purely on haste.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Retribution Paladin</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you. <br/>
<br/>
