<h3 class="heading-size-3 first" id="overall-best-in-slot-gear-for-retribution-paladin">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Retribution Paladin</h3>In Phase 3, the majority of our best in slot gear will come from the new raid, <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6622/throne-of-thunder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of Thunder</span></a>. There also exists new "thunderforged" items that can drop with different stats depending on random chance, some of which will only be best-in-slot if you are able to obtain the right thunderforged stat, making a full best-in-slot set more difficult to obtain. <br/>
<br/>A small amount of reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> can be earned outside of raid and used to purchase the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> items without raiding. Additionally, purchasable <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> items from Phase 1 have had their prices discounted. <br/>
<br/>
<i>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96873/primordius-talisman-of-rage">
<img alt="Primordius' Talisman of Rage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_rampage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Primordius' Talisman of Rage</span></a> is only better than the fully upgraded <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94508/brutal-talisman-of-the-shado-pan-assault">
<img alt="Brutal Talisman of the Shado-Pan Assault" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_strengthofarms.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brutal Talisman of the Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> if you have the 541 iLvl "heroic thunderforged" or fully upgraded variant. </i>
