<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Retribution Paladin in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses available in Phase 3 from the Tier 15 gear are rather strong, and will be highly sought after.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 15 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1162/battlegear-of-the-lightning-emperor">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Battlegear of the Lightning Emperor</span></a></span></h3>
