<del></del></span> Random World Drops</span></h3>These are bind-on-equip <span class="q4">Epic</span> items that have a very low chance to drop from mobs all over the open world. Most people will only ever obtain items like these by purchasing them on the Auction House, and they will be incredibly expensive, particularly early in the expansion, where the item level of these random BoE drops is relatively high at 476. Therefore, it would be wise to keep your eyes peeled for them if you have lots of extra cash to burn, but most players will not be lucky or wealthy enough to obtain these before picking up something better in raids or Celestial dungeons.<ul class="exclude-units">
