<del></del></span> Reputation for Retribution Paladin in Phase 3</span></h2>As an Retribution Paladin, if you are a fresh level 90 and gaining reputation for the first time, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> above all else, followed by <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1387/kirin-tor-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor Offensive</span></a> /<wbr/> <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1388/sunreaver-onslaught">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Onslaught</span></a> and/<wbr/>or <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1375/dominance-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dominance Offensive</span></a> /<wbr/> <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1376/operation-shieldwall">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Operation: Shieldwall</span></a>, depending on your faction, before moving onto other reputations. This is because in Phase 3 these reputations provide the most valuable items and the rewards from others are slightly outdated at this point.<br/>
<br/>The reputation faction <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1387/kirin-tor-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor Offensive</span></a> is the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>Alliance counterpart to the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>Horde faction <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1388/sunreaver-onslaught">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Onslaught</span></a>. Likewise, the faction <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1376/operation-shieldwall">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Operation: Shieldwall</span></a> is the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>Alliance counterpart to the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>Horde faction <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1375/dominance-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dominance Offensive</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>The best of the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
