<img alt="Ghost Reaver's Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ghost Reaver's Gauntlets</span></a> - another solid pre-raid pair of gloves crafted by Blacksmiths, with a pattern requiring <span class="rep-honored">Honored</span> with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a>. However, notably weaker than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87407/bloodforged-warfists">
<img alt="Bloodforged Warfists" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodforged Warfists</span></a>.</div></li></ul>
